cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use IPFD in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "IPFD: Isaac Policy Failure Debugger"
abstract: >-
  A headless debugging utility for robot-policy rollouts in Isaac Lab that
  localizes the oracle-relative point after which a provided recovery controller
  no longer succeeds, and reports whether any internal signal predicted the
  failure before it was externally observable. Scope is Franka Emika Panda
  single-object pick-and-place.
type: software
authors:
